      "updated_at": "2019-01-29T03:56:49Z",
      "body": "> Oh, I actually think the fix is not to restrict access to the links but rather fix the shared documents accessibility: the links are absolutely visible in this repository (see [here](https://github.com/thewca/worldcubeassociation.org/blob/7791f9f8058849914257d12b41aa40d8d88023e5/WcaOnRails/app/views/delegates_panel/index.html.erb#L17) for instance)!\r\n> \r\n> @thewca/board, do you think it makes sense to just restrict access to mentioned documents?\r\n> I'd say Delegates + Board for the probationary status policy, and Seniors + Board for the Senior forms.\r\n\r\nI already had a draft in my email to the Board about changing the forms access. Now that all WCA users have @wca accounts, it is quite easy to make forms visible to the users we want without worry if the link is shared.\r\n\r\nI'll take care of this on the Board's side to make sure the permissions are updated appropriately and then let you know here how we should update the panel.",
